P96 driver development headers, release 3.6.0

These three headers are copied unchanged from the P96 driver SDK in
https://github.com/mheyer32/p96drivers/tree/master/Picasso96Develop
Snapshot: e6fd03e87486fd3dc4f5ca41934a843b7911d0a1

Sources:
  PrivateInclude/boardinfo.h
  PrivateInclude/settings.h
  Include/libraries/Picasso96.h

Authors: Alexander Kneer, Tobias Abt, Thomas Richter and Individual
Computers. See P96CardDevelop.readme for the SDK's CC-BY redistribution
terms and attribution. These headers describe the driver ABI; no P96
implementation or card-driver binary is included.

Interface documentation:
https://wiki.icomp.de/wiki/P96_Driver_Development
